<title>UK: Reuters has no comment on Reed bid talk.</title>
<headline>Reuters has no comment on Reed bid talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reuters Holdings Plc said on Sunday it had no comment on a Sunday Telegraph newspaper report it might make a hostile bid for Anglo-Dutch publisher Reed Elsevier.</p>
<p>&quot;It is company policy never to comment on market rumours,&quot; a spokesman for Reuters said.</p>
<p>The Sunday Telegraph said there was growing speculation Reuters was contemplating a hostile bid for Reed Elsevier. The paper said tentative merger talks between the two had failed because of &quot;cultural differences&quot;.</p>
